ructive rotating ring.\nDesigned with a modern black & white interface, NdsRing V2 delivers both performance and domination, while remaining easy to use.\n🔥 Main Features\n🌀 Unanchored Parts Ring\nPulls almost all unanchored map parts and keeps them rotating around your character in real time.\n🎯 Launch Nearest Player\nAutomatically throws all collected parts at the closest player for maximum impact.\n⛔ Stop System\nInstantly stops all ring and launch actions safely.\n📏 Adjustable Radius (Range Control)\nIncrease or decrease the ring size dynamically.\n⚡ High-Performance Physics Control\nOptimized for smooth movement and minimal lag.\n🖥️ Modern GUI (Black & White)\nClean, powerful, and draggable interface inspired by professional exploit tools.\n🎮 Client-Side & Safe to Use\nWorks without server-side checks and does not require purchases.\n🎯 Best Used In\nNatural Disaster Survival\nPhysics-based chaos gameplay\nFun trolling and domination sessions\n👤 Script Creator\nCreated by: Urobini","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6918b12b1c8fdee123611b36","username":"MEGAxk","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/98ef1d9c86e6d4453a688704212f70199671b005905298805d9ae83ac6d5c294.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6918b12b1c8fdee123611b36-1776964415673.jpeg"},"lvl":8,"status":"offline","id":"6918b12b1c8fdee123611b36","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/98ef1d9c86e6d4453a688704212f70199671b005905298805d9ae83ac6d5c294.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6918b12b1c8fdee123611b36-1776964415673.jpeg"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-24T02:35:42.386Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"694ffedc31e76adf31c6a0a9","editBy":{"_id":"6918b1